<http://example.org/standard/aan-application-for-registration-as-referred-to-in-paragraph-1-with-a-view-to-demonstrate-that-the-applicant-third-country-system-operator-and-the-third-country-system-comply-with-all-relevant-requirements-set-out-in-this-article-including-the-conditions-set-out-in-article-14-and-to-specify-the-information-the-application-shall-contain-on-the-members-of-the-third-country-system-established-in-the-union> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "(a)an application for registration as referred to in paragraph 1 with a view to demonstrate that the applicant third-country system operator and the third-country system comply with all relevant requirements set out in this Article, including the conditions set out in Article 14, and to specify the information the application shall contain on the members, of the third-country system, established in the Union;"@en .

<http://example.org/standard/athe-uniform-electronic-formats-for-the-application-for-registration-referred-to-in-paragraph-1-to-be-submitted-to-the-central-database> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "(a)the uniform electronic formats for the application for registration referred to in paragraph 1, to be submitted to the central database;"@en .

<http://example.org/standard/ban-application-for-designation-as-referred-to-in-article-41-with-a-view-to-demonstrate-that-the-applicant-system-operator-and-the-system-comply-with-all-the-relevant-requirements-of-this-regulation> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "(b)an application for designation as referred to in Article 4(1), with a view to demonstrate that the applicant system operator and the system comply with all the relevant requirements of this Regulation."@en .

<http://example.org/standard/bthe-uniform-electronic-formats-for-the-application-for-designation-referred-to-in-article-41-to-be-submitted-to-the-central-database> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "(b)the uniform electronic formats for the application for designation referred to in Article 4(1), to be submitted to the central database."@en .

<http://example.org/standard/eba-in-close-cooperation-with-the-escb-may-develop-draft-regulatory-technical-standards-to-further-specify-the-conditions-referred-to-in-article-51-for-payment-systems> a dcterms:Standard ;
